  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of ENI/2017/040-208 - Regional Programme on Statistics with Eurostat in the Eastern Partnership &#xbf; Statistics Through Eastern Partnership (STEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Evaluation of Regional Programme on Statistics with Eurostat in the Eastern Partnership &#xbf; Statistics Through Eastern Partnership (STEP), following the conclusion of the programme. The evaluation will aim to provide the relevant services of the European Union and the interested stakeholders with an overall independent assessment of the performance of the programme, paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives, and the reasons underpinning such results. It will also identify key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve future interventions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
